Requirements
Python 3.8+
NumPy
pandas
Jupyter Notebook or JupyterLab
PyTorch (optional, only for the autograd verification cell)
bash
pip install numpy pandas notebook
pip install torch   # optional
How to run
bash
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd <your-repo-folder>
jupyter notebook Lab_07_Neural_Network_2330-0141.ipynb

Then run all cells (Kernel -> Restart & Run All). The notebook also runs in Google Colab.

